<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-41] Missing HiveInterpreter configuration at Configuration.java</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-41</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;HiveInterpreter is introduced by &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-11&quot; title=&quot;Add a HiveQL interpreter to zeppelin&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-11&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-11&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;
But Configuration.java misses it&apos;s class name in zeppelin.interpreters property.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Result is, without conf/zeppelin-site.xml defined with HiveInterpreter, it can not be used with default configuration.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
